### ==================== 登录注册接口测试 ====================

### 1. 注册新用户
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "tom",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": "小汤"
}

### 2. 登录（正确密码）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jack",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. 登录（错误密码）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "jack",
  "password": "wrongpass"
}
